WEBVTT

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:26.750
<i>New days, it's the morning we begin. 
Let's give the world a kiss.</i>

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:35.240
<i>Blowing in the wind, with a little 
courage and love in our pockets.</i>

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:44.090
<i>I wish: If only I had wings,</i>

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:53.690
<i>I could fly over the sadness, 
the past, and my doubts.</i>

00:00:53.690 --> 00:01:02.450
<i>Oh, yeah! There's nothing to lose. 
(Take whatever the brand new day brings.)</i>

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:07.290
<i>Take my way! I wanna catch a miracle...</i>

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:11.030
<i>in the palm of my hand!</i>

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:19.720
<i>We're off on a journey through the endless 
earth, the skies, and the future.</i>

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:32.140
<i>I know these newborn wings, oh! 
Are gonna gonna gonna shine someday!</i>

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:40.280
Miss Pacifica is...

00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:44.100
...the Scrapped Princess...

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:53.030
You awake?

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:57.630
Your color has really improved.

00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:59.430
You seem to be past the worst of it,

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:01.350
but take it easy for a while.

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:03.810
Shouldn't you two get some sleep?

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:06.350
A sick person doesn't need 
to worry about other people.

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:07.980
I'll bring you some food.

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:10.250
You have to build up your strength.

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:16.940
"The Pied Piper Song of the Knights"

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:32.380
It looks like the poison is mostly gone.

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:35.020
It's safe for you to get out of bed now.

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:37.820
Just to be safe, take those 
medicinal herbs one more time.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:39.670
Sir Doyle...

00:02:40.770 --> 00:02:43.680
You heard about who I am, right?

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:44.600
Yeah.

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:48.030
The reason you quit being a 
knight was because long ago,

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:49.810
you took the Scrapped Princess and...

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:53.340
Yeah. That's right.

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:57.780
I'm the man who threw you into 
a ravine when you were a baby.

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:04.240
I don't expect to be forgiven 
just because I treated you.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:08.200
Go on, don't hold back.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.210
I know that there's a lot 
that you want to say to me.

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:14.170
I'm sorry.

00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:19.130
I turned your life upside down, didn't I?

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:22.090
I'm sorry.

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:25.500
Are you apologizing?

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:28.100
To the man who tried to kill you?

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:33.950
How is it that a girl like 
you can be so strong...?

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:38.530
I became frightened.

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:40.800
I thought that to stay true to <i>my </i>justice,

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:44.180
I would have to shatter another's.

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:49.730
That I would make a mistake one day 
that I wouldn't be able to take back.

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:51.960
I became frightened of that, and I ran away.

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:54.250
But in spite of that, you...

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:58.830
I'm much obliged for your concern.

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:01.550
But your words are enough for me.

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:04.220
You already carry the 
burden of a cruel destiny.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.500
If I made you shoulder 
the sins of my own past,

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.930
I couldn't go on living as a human being.

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:13.180
Sir Doyle...

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:17.730
Are you sure we can't give you a ride home?

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:20.780
Yeah, I'll take my time and walk back.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:22.570
Thank you for your help.

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:23.990
Survive this.

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:26.370
That's all I can say to you.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:27.990
Yes, sir.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:28.830
No matter what.

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:46.340
Be careful, that's dangerous!

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:50.440
But your guard was completely down, Leo!

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:53.100
You'll never make it as a knight like that!

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:56.560
See, look!

00:04:56.890 --> 00:04:58.910
I'm feeling perfectly fine now!

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:04.510
But wasn't it a little cold, not 
coming to pay me a visit even once?

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:05.030
Well, um...

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:09.330
Oh, your words of love to 
me were all lies, I see!

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:11.240
You were toying with my heart, weren't you?!

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:13.700
I was not! I just...

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:17.870
I know.

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:24.500
Thanks. And not just for the herbs.

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:26.930
Traveling with you has been fun.

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:29.890
I'm sorry that I didn't tell you.

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:33.920
I wasn't trying to deceive 
you or anything, Leo.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:35.590
I'm sorry.

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:53.540
Have you seen Leo?

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.620
No. His horse is gone, too.

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:58.000
Oh...

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.540
The next time we see him,

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:01.160
we should be on our guard.

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:04.260
He might take a swing at you out of the blue.

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:05.550
Shannon!

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:09.090
Now that he's found out that you're 
the Scrapped Princess, it's possible.

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:11.550
Leo would never do such a thing!

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:14.520
I wouldn't be surprised, 
no matter who turns on us!

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:17.980
I don't want a repeat of what 
happened yesterday, understand?

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:25.440
Oh, it's you.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:27.190
Sir Barrett...

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:28.580
I...

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:31.910
I don't know what I should do.

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:36.450
If Miss Pacifica is truly the catastrophe 
that will destroy the world,

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:37.910
then as a knight, I...

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:40.040
But I...

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:42.580
I'm not a knight, I'm a doctor.

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:45.340
I can't sort out your doubts for you.

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:47.570
When you're a doctor,

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:50.180
you can save the person in front of you,

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:51.800
even if the person is evil.

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:55.760
Of course, you might be killed the 
instant you save them, though.

00:06:56.720 --> 00:07:01.770
You said that chivalry is to wield a 
sword in the name of justice, didn't you?

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:05.770
If that's true, then take off her head.

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:08.340
That should earn you a 
medal at the very least.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:12.640
That's the sort of path 
that you're striving for.

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:19.080
What do you suppose the 
Scrapped Princess is, anyway?

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:26.000
I wonder how many people 
will be hurt because of me?

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:33.750
Say, Chris.

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:35.930
If my little sister is alive,

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:38.610
do you suppose that she would look like me?

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:40.890
Yes, I'm sure she would.

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:43.400
The poison that will destroy the world, eh?

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:47.110
What do you suppose that revelation meant?

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.170
I'm not sure.

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:51.400
If it were learned that my sister were alive,

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:53.860
I suppose she'd be targeted for death again.

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:57.530
I'm sure that our mother is worried, as well.

00:07:57.530 --> 00:07:58.870
The queen?

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:02.390
Of course, I haven't seen my 
mother in quite some time.

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:06.750
Father!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:09.670
I'm speaking with a friend at the moment.

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:11.150
Who is that?

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:12.440
Lift your face.

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:13.160
Yes, sire.

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:17.220
My name is Christopher Bairach, Majesty.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:20.140
Bairach's adopted son, eh?

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:27.890
Surprising, isn't it?

00:08:27.890 --> 00:08:30.940
It's always like that 
between my father and me.

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:32.820
My father hates me.

00:08:39.230 --> 00:08:42.250
Still, that assassin with 
the instrument is...

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:43.960
You mean The Silencer?

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:46.640
Do you think he'll attack us again?

00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:47.930
I'm not so sure.

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:50.710
He played nice and withdrew back there.

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:53.570
Don't tell me how you got him to "play nice."

00:08:53.570 --> 00:08:55.680
It'll turn my stomach.

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:00.020
Who the heck is that?

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.600
Shannon?

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:12.300
Step forward, Guardians.

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:18.980
What the...?

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:24.070
What am I doing?

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:28.090
He's...

00:09:29.970 --> 00:09:31.340
This guy's no ordinary human!

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:36.030
It's futile.

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:40.970
I, a Peacemaker, have gotten involved.

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:43.560
It will not be like last time.

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:44.980
Last time?

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:54.740
He was responsible for that?!

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:56.860
Shannon?

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:59.700
Do not move, Scrapped Princess.

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:03.660
I will force these two to 
kill each other if I must.

00:10:04.820 --> 00:10:08.500
Humans obey me completely.

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:12.540
This is Providence as it should be.

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:33.020
Big brother! Big sister!

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:42.030
Damn it! Damn it!

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:43.410
What good is justice?!

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:45.830
What's the point of chivalry?!

00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:51.880
Shannon! Raquel!

00:10:57.250 --> 00:10:58.760
Miss Pacifica...

00:11:01.210 --> 00:11:03.110
Leo, please! I need your...

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:17.110
"Silence, that was the 
language of their love," eh?

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:18.150
How dull.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.570
Silencer!

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:20.930
Oh, my.

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:22.530
What were you doing with that sword?

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:27.490
That young lady there is the poison 
that will destroy the world.

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:31.120
You weren't about to kill her, were you?

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:33.790
Be quiet! I was...

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:35.460
Your name is "Silencer," right?

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:39.960
Can Bugs also be used to look for people?

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:42.970
Yes, I suppose.

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:44.340
Will you make a deal?

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:46.700
Deal?

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:49.390
I'll give you one of my hands.

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:51.940
That will let you collect 
the bounty on me, right?

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:53.980
Miss Pacifica?!

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:58.860
So you're saying that you'll give me an arm 
if I let you go and say that I killed you?

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:00.190
No, I'm not!

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:03.200
I said I wanted to deal.

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:05.490
I'll give you a hand.

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:10.910
In return, use your Bugs to find out 
where my brother and sister are.

00:12:11.260 --> 00:12:12.360
You want me to what?

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:19.630
Leo... Will you do me this one last favor?

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:22.170
Cut it off.

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:26.050
Please... Hurry!

00:12:35.950 --> 00:12:38.890
Shannon and Raquel were kidnapped.

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:42.900
This is all I can do for them.

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:49.370
I'm in a hurry!

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:54.330
Please.

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:20.940
I don't carry a sword to do things like this!

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:21.900
A sword...

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:25.240
A sword isn't just about cutting people down!

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:31.550
Um, look...

00:13:31.550 --> 00:13:33.200
I think there's been a misunderstanding here.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:36.640
I know when to cut my losses.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:39.210
Well, to be frank,

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:45.860
I don't want those two coming after 
me for revenge because I hurt you.

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:47.680
But I need this!

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:49.310
What I'm saying is,

00:13:49.310 --> 00:13:50.640
I'll do it without making a deal.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:55.850
The maiden offers up an 
arm, the knight, his life,

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:59.520
and the poet, his soul.

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:06.050
Fly, my hands and feet!

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:13.760
Browning...

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:17.860
Here in one of the fortresses 
your kind was so proud of,

00:14:17.860 --> 00:14:20.460
your last hope will be extinguished.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:25.740
Afterwards, I expect that the humans 
will exterminate the Lawbreaker.

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:31.590
A relic of the ancient world, eh?

00:14:33.460 --> 00:14:36.060
What can a mere Bug do against me?

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:42.690
Your disdain for everything but 
yourself is what makes you a fool.

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:49.240
Looks like they found them.

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:52.620
This fellow will show you 
the way, so follow it.

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:58.900
Thank you, old man Silencer!

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:03.250
O-Old man?

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:05.450
I see...

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:09.130
You tapped into the Bugs' communications 
net, didn't you, Zefiris?

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:14.390
The only one who may call me by 
that name is my D-Knight master.

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:17.180
A second-rate product like you 
has no right to call me that.

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:21.140
Second-rate product, you say?

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:23.150
Don't push me.

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:32.530
That's him!

00:15:32.890 --> 00:15:34.680
Go over there! Hurry!

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:36.990
Leo?

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:39.700
What are you doing, Leo?

00:15:42.110 --> 00:15:46.380
Manifest class two divine retribution 
enforcement configuration.

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:04.270
I-It's no use... I can't!

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:05.880
I can't go there...

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:08.750
I mustn't disobey that!

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:10.440
What's wrong, Leo?!

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:12.610
That's nothing but a stupid monster!

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:15.240
It's hopeless! I can't fight 
against something like that!

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:17.200
Leo!

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:24.170
Miss Pacifica?

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:29.880
You may have planned to make one of 
the Guardians into your new master,

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:33.470
but they are now under the 
rule of my Providence.

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:36.050
You have no hope of winning.

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:48.010
Big brother!

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:50.690
Big sister!

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:56.660
Can't I protect her?

00:16:58.770 --> 00:17:00.840
He's just too powerful...

00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:05.120
There's nothing I can do...

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:08.750
Did you not swear to protect her?

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:12.090
You're right... I swore I would.

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:18.390
I swore I'd protect her against 
anything that tried to take her away.

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:21.250
I want power...

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:24.020
Enough power to change destiny.

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:25.850
Enough power to fight,

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:27.930
even if it makes the whole world

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:29.980
and God himself my enemy.

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:33.990
That is your will, then?

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:36.450
Then I shall obey.

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:38.310
Though it be temporary,

00:17:38.310 --> 00:17:42.130
I recognize thee as fit to be 
my controller, the D-Knight.

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:49.830
I, ARFFI M4 Dragoon, Serial 26, "Zefiris,"

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:53.350
shall be thy blade and slay thine enemy.

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:14.570
Big brother! Big sister!

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:15.460
Look out!

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:17.280
Perish!

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:30.460
A Dragoon?

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:33.800
What's going on?

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:36.680
Why do I have this power?

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:40.400
Protect our little sister.

00:18:47.320 --> 00:18:50.080
I'll tear you apart, right down 
to your elementary particles.

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:55.960
Barrier, defend us!

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:07.110
Curse you!

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.670
What?!

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:37.280
I am a weapon that was sent 
to you from a time long past.

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:41.450
The last dragon, hidden in the 
interstices of space itself,

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:47.290
meant to save you when you 
had the will to fight God.

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:51.960
Fight God?

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:53.830
I don't really understand.

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:56.280
All we did was...

00:19:56.280 --> 00:19:58.170
For now, that does not matter.

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:00.840
But know this.

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:04.140
I am not yet completely restored.

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:08.350
There is a time limit to how 
long I can come to this world.

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:12.100
Also, I cannot interfere 
in quarrels between humans.

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:14.100
I am not omnipotent by any means.

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:19.320
However, when the time comes for you to 
fight the three remaining Peacemakers,

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:23.780
and when you fight the 
divine Mauser, call me.

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:29.040
Call my true name, the name that only 
my master is permitted to call me.

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:30.280
Zefiris.

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.370
Zefiris...

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:33.860
When that time comes,

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:36.920
I will become the blade 
of D-Knight Shannon Cassul

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:38.480
and slay thy enemies.

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:40.760
D-Knight?

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:46.220
I have waited for more than 
5,000 years to assist thee.

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:47.490
I...

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:49.300
Let us meet again,

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:52.470
my temporary master.

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:58.380
Big brother?

00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:01.310
What is it?

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:05.610
What's the Scrapped Princess?

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:15.370
I think I'll return to Taurus for a while.

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:17.460
Thanks for everything.

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:19.500
We'll miss you.

00:21:20.850 --> 00:21:24.330
Miss Pacifica... I'm still uncertain.

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:28.470
About whether or not chivalry 
is just some formless illusion.

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:33.850
I want to believe that there is a justice 
that everyone can believe in, though.

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:37.110
But once I find that answer,

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:40.390
I might become your enemy.

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:44.400
That's okay. I don't mind.

00:22:02.320 --> 00:22:03.210
Until we meet again.

00:22:03.490 --> 00:22:05.170
Right. Until then.

00:22:13.810 --> 00:22:19.870
Those who are pursued and those who go 
off in pursuit of something part ways.

00:22:20.360 --> 00:22:23.150
And yet... And yet...

00:22:24.630 --> 00:22:27.400
I guess I'm not really cut out to be a poet.

00:22:41.580 --> 00:22:46.730
<i>A blessing of rain falls quietly. (Falls.)</i>

00:22:46.730 --> 00:22:52.050
<i>Droplets of my love, 
which fall for someone...</i>

00:22:52.050 --> 00:22:59.230
<i>who is still waiting in a land far away.</i>

00:22:59.230 --> 00:23:05.020
<i>The morning wind blows, caressing 
my cheek. (What was that...)</i>

00:23:05.020 --> 00:23:10.150
<i>Did you feel something, feel something 
just now? (...on my cheek?)</i>

00:23:10.150 --> 00:23:13.320
<i>It goes up to the one and only sky... 
(More certain than anything.)</i>

00:23:13.320 --> 00:23:18.370
<i>a sky which has a fixed, certain meaning.</i>

00:23:18.370 --> 00:23:24.920
<i>I come to a stop in the shadow 
of clouds that chase after me.</i>

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:28.380
<i>This journey of the heart 
that I wish to gaze upon...</i>

00:23:28.380 --> 00:23:31.590
<i>goes on forever and goes on forever.</i>

00:23:31.590 --> 00:23:38.220
<i>One day I will chance upon the 
voice I've not heard in so long.</i>

00:23:38.220 --> 00:23:40.180
<i>Alainn la-li-la.</i>

00:23:40.180 --> 00:23:44.900
<i>At last the ship sets sail, sets sail. 
(The ship glides on forever...)</i>

00:23:44.900 --> 00:23:50.190
<i>Yes, believe in this wide world... 
(...to the edge of seas unknown.)</i>

00:23:50.190 --> 00:23:53.530
<i>and go off into the distance.</i>

00:23:53.530 --> 00:23:57.630
<i>And onwards into the future.</i>

00:23:58.490 --> 00:24:11.510
"Next Time"

00:23:59.880 --> 00:24:02.540
Shannon comes across a 
little girl in the rain.

00:24:02.540 --> 00:24:06.250
She has no memories, except 
that her name is Cin.

00:24:06.650 --> 00:24:09.510
This looks like it will be a 
melancholy, rain-soaked story.

00:24:09.510 --> 00:24:11.510
Next time on <i>Scrapped Princess</i>,

00:24:11.510 --> 00:24:13.280
"Waltz of the Abandoned Dog of a Girl."

00:24:13.280 --> 00:24:14.580
Please tune in!
